Open item raised for the human (recorded, not decided here):
- B-3's second half — requiring a *registered* durable Data Protection provider
  outside Development, in addition to the two configured settings — is NOT
  implemented. Implementing it makes every already-merged portal test that
  starts a Production host fail, and HealthEndpointTests.cs is in no spec 011
